OL,3,AImmigration agents search Congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS immigration agents searched the home
OL,7,Fof Minnesota Representative Ilhan Omar
OL,8,Fon Monday morning as part of a
OL,9,F"criminal investigation".
OL,11,FHomeland Security Investigations (HSI)
OL,12,Fagents "executed a judicially
OL,13,Fauthorized search warrant" for the home
OL,14,Fin the Washington, DC, area, a US
OL,15,Fjustice department spokesperson told
OL,16,Fthe BBC.
OL,18,FThe search "is part of an ongoing
OL,19,Ffederal criminal investigation," the
OL,20,Fspokesperson said, but no further
OL,21,Fdetails were given.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
