OL,3,AImmigration agents search Congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FOmar was born in Somalia and came to
OL,7,Fthe US aged 12 after four years in a
OL,8,FKenyan refugee camp. First elected to
OL,9,FCongress in 2018, she is running for
OL,10,Freelection next month, and is an
OL,11,Foutspoken critic of President Donald
OL,12,FTrump.
